  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="0507C"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ios3">
        <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e98">Caput 3</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e102">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_3@5-16">Cum videritis arcam testimonii Dei nostri, et sacerdotes, et Levitas portantes eam,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios3-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ios3-Nd1e110" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest, 3 in Josue.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs">Longe jussum est arcam praecedere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nube subtracta, tanquam velamine ablato.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e125">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_6@9-10">Praecedite populum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios3-Rd1e132"><name xml:id="gom-ios3-Nd1e133" ref="#Origen">ORIG.</name>, hom. IV.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e137">Per sacerdotes deducitur populus, et iter agit ad terram repromissionis magisterio sacerdotum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_6">Et infra:</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Ipsi <pb ed="#P" n="0508A"/> enim sunt qui edocent populum exire de Aegypto, de erroribus scilicet mundi, et transire per eremum vastam, id est, tentationum genera diversa transcurrere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e151">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e153">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e155">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e157" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_7@5-8">Hodie incipiam exaltare te,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios3-Rd1e160"><name xml:id="gom-ios3-Nd1e161" ref="#Origen">ID.</name>, ubi supra.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e165">Multa prodigia in eremo gesta sunt, et nusquam dicitur exaltatus Jesus. Ubi vero transitur Jordanes, dicitur ad eum: <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e167" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_7@5-8">Hodie incipiam exaltare te,</quote> etc. Exaltatio enim Jesu in conspectu populi a baptismo sumit exordium. Qui enim baptizantur, in morte ipsius baptizantur, cujus mors in crucis exaltatione completur. Merito ergo cuique fidelium tunc primum Jesus exaltatur, cum ad mysterium baptismi pervenit. Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e170" source="http://scta.info/resource/phil2_9@5-13">Exaltavit illum Deus, et donavit illi nomen quod est super omne nomen,</quote> etc.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e176">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e178">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e180">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0508B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_9@11-13">Domini Dei vestri,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios3-Rd1e187"><name xml:id="gom-ios3-Nd1e188" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, hom. 4 in Jos.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e192"><seg type="qs">Peccatori omnis creatura hostis est</seg>, etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e197" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_8@1-10">qui convertit petram in stagna aquarum, et rupem in fontes,</quote> etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e204">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e206">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e208">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10@20-20">Chananaeus,</quote>
            possidens, vel possessio, vel negotiatores, vel motabilis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10">Hethaeus,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            formidans sive stupens.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e222">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10@22-22">Hevaeus,</quote>
            lapides colligens.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e228">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e230" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10">Pherezaeus,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            separans, sive disseminans.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10@25-25">Gergesaeus,</quote>
            colonum applica, vel colonum ejiciens, sive advena appropinquans.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e243">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e245" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10@28-28">Amorrhaeus,</quote>
            amarus vel loquens.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_10@30-30">Jebusaeus,</quote>
            calcantes, vel praesepe eorum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e258">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e260">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_15@18-19">Messis impleverat.</quote>
            LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e265" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIsam21_9@20-22">Sicut in diebus messis tritici.</quote> Hoc incredibile videtur regionibus nostris, ibi autem (sicut perhibent qui noverunt) in <pb ed="#P" n="0508C"/> initio veris est messis tritici: tunc autem ille fluvius redundat et impletur amplius quam per hiemem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios3-Dd1e272">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios3-Hd1e274">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios3-d1e276">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e278" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios3_16@1-3">Steterunt aquae descendentes,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios3-Rd1e281"><name xml:id="gom-ios3-Nd1e282" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, hom. 4.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios3-Qd1e286"><seg type="qs">Non absque mysterii ratione arbitror scriptum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et unus Spiritus quo omnes purificantur in baptismo, et unus Deus Pater omnium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
